## Changes

The 30 sampling and print schedule specifications now live in
`stats_schedule_specs()`. Both the runtime-owned scheduler queue and public
`ConsumerStatsManager::with_scheduler` use that definition, including schedule
order, periods, and local-boundary delays. Runtime task kinds retain the owning
stats set and print window. Commit `4d32bc97` contains the shared-spec refactor.

The all-features workspace run exposed a race in the protocol API fixture: one
test changed process-wide `TopicConfig` defaults while parallel tests read
them. The three tests that read or mutate those defaults now share a test-only
mutex. Commit `2598c76f` contains the synchronization fix.

