## Acceptance boundary

Both Rust scheduler registration paths use the same 30 schedule definitions,
and the pre-start client shutdown regression covers the 32 returned entries
(two submitted futures plus 30 recurring stats jobs). Broad P18-V01
bidirectional source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and reverse-export
reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Native Windows runtime and current-revision
remote CI remain open. No plan was edited, no push or remote CI was run, and
the four user-owned Phase 19 paths remain untouched and unstaged.
